OL,3,GNEWSA'Weak' vehicle testing contract
OL,4,Acost #5m and contributed to MOT delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA weakly drafted contract meant the
OL,7,FDriver and Vehicle Agency (DVA) took
OL,8,Fyears to get rid of a company which was
OL,9,Ffailing to deliver an upgrade of its
OL,10,Fvehicle testing centres, a spending
OL,11,Fwatchdog has found.
OL,13,FThe NI Audit Office (NIAO) investigated
OL,14,Fthe botched deal which wasted #5m and
OL,15,Fhas contributed to long delays in
OL,16,Fimproving the MOT centres.
OL,18,FIt found that the company involved had
OL,19,Ffallen six weeks behind schedule within
OL,20,Fjust six months of winning the contract
OL,21,Fin 2019.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
