OL,3,GNEWSA'Weak' vehicle testing contract
OL,4,Acost #5m and contributed to MOT delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a protracted legal process it was
OL,7,Feventually paid #1.5m to go away in
OL,8,F2025, described as "a significant
OL,9,Ffruitless expenditure".
